<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>产检 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E4%BA%A7%E6%A3%80/</link><description>Recent content in 产检 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E4%BA%A7%E6%A3%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>孕产与儿科：产检、问医生注意事项、带孩子看病、疫苗时间表</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/pregnancy-and-pediatric/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/pregnancy-and-pediatric/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;从怀孕到带娃，美国的产检和儿科是&lt;strong&gt;两套固定的节奏&lt;/strong&gt;：产检按孕周排频率，儿科按月份打疫苗、做体检。把这两张时间表记住，跟医生说话就不会慌——他们问的几乎每一句，都在表上。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>